			"name": "Void-Born Origin",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Born aboard a voidship, space station, or Rogue Trader vessel and never planetside until adulthood, if ever — a background Rogue Trader-line fiction and Only War's Void Born package both use, with the same trade-off: comfortable in zero-g and cramped spaces, unsettled by open planetary horizons.\n\nDesign: Net 0 points, two Basic Set perks/quirks. Disabled by default; GM/player enables it.",
